{"strongs": "H7723", "word": "שָׁוְא", "translit": "shav", "root": "שוא", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "emptiness, vanity", "definition": "שָׁוְא noun [masculine] emptiness, vanity ; — ׳ שׁ absolute Exod 23:1 + 51 t., שָׁו Job 15:31 ( Kt ); — 1. emptiness, nothingness, vanity: תְּשׁוּעַת אָרָם ׳ שׁ Ps 60:13 vain (is) man's deliverance , = Ps 108:13 לָכֶם ׳ שׁ Ps 127:2 it is vain (useless) for you ; Ps 89:48 for ( עַל ) what nothingness hast thou created man ? compare ׳ יַרְחֵי שׁ Job 7:3 ׳ הַבְלֵי שׁ Ps 31:7 (idols) = Jonah 2:9 , compare Jer 18:15 + Hos 5:11 ᵐ5 (for צָו ); ׳ מִנְחַת שׁ Isa 1:13 of ineffective offering to ׳ י ; ׳ נשׂא לַשּׁ ( לֹא ) Exod 20:7 (twice in verse) take up name of God in vain (to no good purpose) = Deut 5:11 (twice in verse), compare Ps 24:4 ; Ps 139:20 [ ᵑ0 lifted up in vain are thy foes , but read שְׁמֶ֑ךָ for עָרֶיךָ , compare נשׂא 1 b ( 7 ); al. עָלֶיךָ , see II. עָר ]; ׳ היה שׁ Hos 12:12 become nothing ( We ׳ עשׂה שׁ , and so 3 ); ׳ ראה שׁ Ps 119:37 adverb ׳ לַשּׁ in vain Jer 2:30 ; Jer 4:30 ; Jer 6:29 ; Jer 46:11 ׳ שׁ Ps 127:1 (twice in verse); Mal 3:14 . 2. emptiness of speech , || lying , ׳ שׁ וּדְבַר כָּזָב Prov 30:8 ׳ דבּר שׁ Ps 12:3 ; Ps 41:7 ; Ps 144:8 ; Ps 144:11 ; Isa 59:4 ; Ezek 13:8 ׳ אָלוֺת שׁ Hos 10:4 + Hos 12:2 ᵐ5 We and others (for שֹׁד ); ׳ הָלַךְ עִםשֿׁ Job 31:5 (|| מִרְמָה ); ׳ עֵד שׁ Deut 5:17 (= עֵד שָֽׁקֶר Exod 20:16 ); compare ׳ שֵׁמַע שׁ Exod 23:1 ( E ); of false (empty) prophecy ׳ חֲזוֺן שׁ Ezek 12:24 , ׳ חָזוּ שׁ Lam 2:14 see also Ezek 13:6 ; Ezek 13:7 ; Ezek 13:9 ; Ezek 13:23 ; Ezek 21:34 ; Ezek 22:28 ; Job 35:13 (or empty complaining, below 1 ); ׳ קסם שׁ Ezek 21:28 חֲלֹמוֺת ׳ הַשּׁ Zech 10:2 . 3. of conduct, worthlessness ( Buhl below 1, 2 ); ׳ מְרתי שׁ worthless men Ps 26:4 ; Job 11:11 worthless motives (in figurative) ׳ חַבְלֵי הַשּׁ Isa 5:18 ׳ נָפַת שׁ Isa 30:28 (i.e. sifting out the worthless; al. sieve of (bringing) disappointment ); play on meanings in Job 15:31 (twice in verse), compare Dr Job, Psalt. 464 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8496')\">BDB8496</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7723')\">H7723</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8495')\">BDB8495</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8497')\">BDB8497</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שָׁוְא</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>emptiness, vanity</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Exod 23:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,1)\">Exod 23:1</ref> + 51 t., <bdbheb>שָׁו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 15:31\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,31)\">Job 15:31</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>emptiness, nothingness, vanity:</highlight> <bdbheb>תְּשׁוּעַת אָרָם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 60:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,13)\">Ps 60:13</ref> <highlight>vain</highlight> (is) <highlight>man's deliverance</highlight>, = <ref ref=\"Ps 108:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"108\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"108\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,108,13)\">Ps 108:13</ref> <bdbheb>לָכֶם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 127:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"127\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"127\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,127,2)\">Ps 127:2</ref> it is <highlight>vain</highlight> (useless) <highlight>for you</highlight>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:48\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,48)\">Ps 89:48</ref> <highlight>for</highlight> (<bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb>) <highlight>what nothingness</highlight> hast thou created man ? compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יַרְחֵי שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 7:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,7,3)\">Job 7:3</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַבְ